Source: Department of State, Central Files, 811.10/9-1261. Secret; Priority;
                    Limited Distribution. Drafted by Joseph E. O’Mahony (EUR/GER) on September 10;
                    cleared by Freshman, Sullivan (Treasury) and Henry J. Kuss, Jr. (DOD/ISA) in
                    substance, Sidney Schmukler (E/OFD) and John C. Renner (EUR/RA) in draft, and
                    David Korn (S/S); and approved by Ball. Repeated to Paris.
